


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_70fa3e65:



    voice "2RI_1234"
    rin "「我回来了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_03f08731:



    voice "2MI_0990"
    miyako "「今天的水温真不错～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_051a287a:


    "刚去洗过澡，身上还冒着热气的两人走进了客厅。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_32cd6156:


    "映入二人眼帘的是阳菜和文两人头靠头肩靠肩坐在一起的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_2f41d457:



    voice "2RI_1235"
    rin "「我去，和我们出去时一个姿势，怎么感觉这两天你们俩比平时粘的还要紧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_7c2fb47d:



    voice "2FU_0947"
    fumi "「啊，欢迎回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_265262ad:



    voice "2MI_0991"
    miyako "「浴室空出来了，你们俩去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_0387a7c2:



    voice "2HI_1197"
    hina "「嗯，再待会」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_ba2ecd77:


    "虽然这么说着，完全没有要动的意思。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_2b6f7032:



    voice "2RI_1236"
    rin "「还靠在一起，看来这比泡澡还重要啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_c6af1b46:


    "就算伦逗她们俩，她俩也只是看了眼伦这边。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_6b678f84:



    voice "2RI_1237"
    rin "「还有为什么你俩都抱着鞋子？丰臣秀吉吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_f8d04f67:


    "两人确实都抱着圣诞节收到的礼物红鞋。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_0571faaf:



    voice "2RI_1238"
    rin "「终于打算穿了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_3f04ff8f:



    voice "2HI_1198"
    hina "「……永远都不穿」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_6fb87c3a:



    voice "2FU_0948"
    fumi "「这是非常重要的回忆，所以我们想珍惜它」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_647ae37e:


    "这么说过后，两人把鞋子抱得更紧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_6447f3cf:



    voice "2RI_1239"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_43bb2939:


    "伦叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_a40b2056:



    voice "2RI_1240"
    rin "「我说，你们俩自从从浅生家店里帮完忙回来后就有点不对劲啊？发生什么了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_2469e48d:



    voice "2HI_1199"
    hina "「……没发生什么」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_bbbd0a7c:


    "没看伦直接就答话的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_f70af1d5:



    voice "2RI_1241"
    rin "「吵架……也不像啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_e4cbdb0c:


    hina_fumi "「怎么会，我最喜欢她了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_5def8a75:



    voice "2RI_1242"
    rin "「那、那挺好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_65248345:



    voice "2RI_1243"
    rin "「虽然和平时没什么区别……但总觉得哪不对啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_feeb24d4:


    "看着与平时不同，毫无活力的两人，伦和圣夜子互相探询着看了看对方。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_9b43c401:



    voice "2FU_0950"
    fumi "「还能像这样互送礼物几次呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_02_90a79999:



    voice "2HI_1201"
    hina "「…………」"
